        "step_content": {
          "type": "information",
          "title": "HTML елементи и CSS оформление",
          "instruction": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"bg\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>\nbody{padding:0;max-width:none}.lesson-demo{max-width:100%}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;color:#25243a;background:#fff;font:20px/1.65 \"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}main{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:20px}h3{font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;color:#54316f;margin:24px 0 12px}p{margin:12px 0}li{margin:8px 0}a{color:#553176;overflow-wrap:anywhere}figure{margin:22px 0;padding:12px;background:#f8f5fb;border:1px solid #ded8e8;border-radius:12px}figure img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:auto;max-height:700px;object-fit:contain}figcaption{font-size:16px;color:#54515e;margin-top:10px}.focus,.task,.note{padding:14px 18px;border-left:5px solid #79509b;border-radius:8px;background:#f3edf8}.note{background:#edf6fa;border-color:#387b88}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;font-size:18px}td,th{padding:10px;border:1px solid #d8cfe1;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere}th{background:#f3edf8}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:17px/1.6 Consolas,monospace;background:#f4f1f7;border-radius:8px;padding:14px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}img,svg{max-width:100%;height:auto}details{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}summary{font-weight:600}.mobile-label{display:none}@media(max-width:500px){body{font-size:18px}main{padding:12px}h3{font-size:21px}table,tbody,tr,td,th{display:block;width:100%!important}thead{display:none}tbody tr{border:1px solid #d8cfe1;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0}tbody td,tbody th{border:0;padding:10px 12px}tbody td:first-child{background:#f3edf8;font-weight:600}tbody td+td{border-top:1px solid #e6deed}.mobile-label{display:block;font-weight:600;color:#54316f;margin-bottom:4px}figure{padding:8px}}</style></head><body><main><h3 id=\"html\">HTML — елементите</h3><pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;h1&gt;Среща на фотографския клуб&lt;/h1&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Следващата среща е в сряда.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;button id=\"toggle-info\" type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"info\" aria-expanded=\"false\"&gt;Покажи подробности&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div id=\"info\" class=\"card\" hidden&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Какво да подготвите?&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Донесете три собствени снимки и кратко описание на всяка.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre><h3 id=\"css\">CSS — оформлението</h3><pre><code class=\"language-css\">* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody { margin: 0; padding: 20px; font: 18px/1.6 Arial, sans-serif; color: #203244; background: #f5f8fa; }\n.demo { max-width: 680px; margin: auto; }\nh1 { font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.25; }\nbutton { font: inherit; padding: .6rem 1rem; color: white; background: #254e70; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; }\nbutton:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #a06000; outline-offset: 3px; }\ninput { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 24rem; font: inherit; padding: .4rem; margin: .2rem 0 1rem; }\n.card { background: white; border: 1px solid #b5c9d4; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; }\n[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n</code></pre><figure><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/martin-lift/Edu108/main/missions/ready/12_class/web-design/23-javascript-show-hide/images/topic-3.svg\" width=\"760\" height=\"276\" alt=\"HTML задава елементите и id; CSS избира и оформя елементите; Проверете текст, контраст и фокус\"><figcaption>HTML елементи и CSS оформление</figcaption></figure></main></body></html>"
